  "description": "COMPACT, CONNECTED, AND EASY TO HANDLE\n\nThe battery can be easily removed from the top of the down tube, while the internal cable routing keeps the design clean. Its low center of gravity ensures stability and control at all times.\n\nBOSCH PERFORMANCE LINE PX MOTOR\n\nThe Bosch Performance Line PX motor delivers up to 90 Nm of torque, providing instant response even on steep climbs or demanding terrain.\n\nIntegrated with the Bosch eBike System, it offers a natural and controlled riding experience.\n\n600WH BATTERY\n\nThe 600Wh battery delivers up to 145 km of range and allows fast charging up to 80%.\n\nCOMPACT AND CONNECTED DISPLAY\n\nDisplay Kiox 300. It shows speed, range, assist level, heart rate, and turn-by-turn navigation via the eBike Flow app.\n\nDisplay Intuvia 100. Its high-contrast screen makes all information easy to read even in direct sunlight, showing speed, assist level, battery charge, and gear shift recommendations.",
